# Agentic Framework - Runtime State Directory
#
# This directory contains TRANSIENT runtime data that persists across
# .agentic/ framework upgrades. NOT part of the framework library.
#
# Contents:
#   plans/            - In-progress feature plans - NOT committed (.gitignore)
#   WIP.md            - Work in progress tracking - NOT committed (.gitignore)
#   AGENTS_ACTIVE.md  - Multi-agent coordination - NOT committed (.gitignore)
#   .verification-state - Doctor verification results - NOT committed (.gitignore)
#
# Git tracking:
#   - ALL contents are gitignored (transient state)
#   - Persistent history lives in .agentic-journal/ (always committed)
#
# Location: Project root (outside .agentic/) to survive upgrades.
#
# Tools that use this:
#   wip.sh       - WIP tracking
#   doctor.py    - Verification state
#   ag.sh        - Gateway commands, plan management
#
# See also: .agentic-journal/ for persistent history (manifests, lessons, journal)
